- hacker_trades.py: the wave-3 Seeker rest (surface-quoting, limit forced to -HACK_MAX_PRICE
  via WAVE3_FORCE_CLAMP_EDGE=99) is replaced by two NBBO-priced waves:
    WAVE 3: remainder sent Seeker with Simple take/make limit classes (works the plain
